    {
      "id": "claim_c729ee3a809044ada0b63b098a6df1d7",
      "statement": "An age key mismatch between SOPS_AGE_KEY_FILE (age.key) and the recipient configured in .sops.yaml fails SOPS encryption/decryption during both bootstrap phases, and the same mismatch in-cluster breaks SOPS decryption of the cluster-meta and cluster-apps Kustomizations.",
